@startuml
title Diagrama de Sequência - Cadastrar Modal
hide footbox

participant "Frontend (View)" as View
participant "ModalController" as Controller
participant "ModalService\n(Model)" as Service
participant "ModalRepository\n(Model)" as Repository

View -> Controller : 1: POST /modais (ModalRequestDTO)
activate Controller

Note over Controller: A anotação @Valid do Spring\nvalida os campos automaticamente.

Controller -> Service : 1.1: criar(dto)
activate Service

Service -> Repository : 1.1.1: save(modal)
activate Repository
Repository --> Service : modalSalvo
deactivate Repository

Service --> Controller : ModalResponseDTO
deactivate Service

Controller --> View : 201 Created (ApiResponse)
deactivate Controller
@enduml
